<p>Software engineer working mostly with Java and Spring Boot, with a soft spot for frontend and DevOps. I write here about what I learn.</p>

<h2>posts</h2>
<ul class="posts">
  {%- for post in collections.posts.slice(0, 5) %}
  <li><time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | isoDate }}</time> <a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></li>
  {%- endfor %}
</ul>
{%- if collections.posts.length > 5 %}
<p><a href="/posts/">all posts →</a></p>
{%- endif %}

<h2>elsewhere</h2>
<p>
  {%- for link in site.links %}
  <a href="{{ link.url }}" rel="noopener">{{ link.label }}</a>{% if not loop.last %} <span class="muted">·</span>{% endif %}
  {%- endfor %}
</p>
